-outlet-store' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='LAPP Tannehill is headquartered in Savage, Minnesota, where it has operated as a family-owned and operated distributor of wire, cable, tubing, connectors, and related products for 60 years. The company functions as an operating affiliate of LAPP, a global network that develops, manufactures, and distributes eight product lines encompassing more than 40,000 items. While the exact founding year is not disclosed, the business has built a national presence with sales teams across the country and additional distribution centers in Nevada and Texas.

The company’s core offering combines product distribution with a suite of value-added services tailored to customer specifications. These services include wire striping and dyeing for identification, twisting, precision cutting and stripping, re-spooling to custom put-ups, wire and cable marking, tubing cutting and hot-stamp marking, custom labeling, kitting of assemblies, and the Quick Pick inventory management program. LAPP Tannehill also assists with custom cable design from specification through delivery. The operation leverages the LAPP group’s broad catalog, which includes brands such as SKINTOP® cord grips and ÖLFLEX® cables.

Its customers range from domestic equipment builders to international contractors seeking reliable wire and cable solutions.

The company attributes its differentiation to four stated values: customer focus, family-based culture, innovation, and success orientation. It emphasizes that cooperation based on trust drives customer success, that its family-owned structure fosters a familiar atmosphere for employees and clients, that it develops forward-looking solutions, and that independence and profitable growth guide its strategy. The Quick Pick program and extensive value-added services are presented as practical expressions of these principles.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire striping & dyeing", "Wire twisting", "Re-spooling", "Wire cutting & stripping", "Wire & cable marking", "Tubing cutting & marking", "Custom labeling", "Kitting", "Inventory management (Quick Pick)", "Custom cable design", "Machining & tooling"], "industries": ["Automotive & specialty vehicles", "Construction", "Food & beverage", "Mass transit", "Material handling", "Medical", "Oil & gas", "Packaging equipment", "Renewable energy", "Security", "Wire harness manufacturing", "Automation", "Energy storage & EVs", "Aerospace", "Military & defense", "Building & contractors", "Lighting manufacturing", "Equipment manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated with 60 years of experience", "Operating affiliate of LAPP, providing access to 40,000+ products across 8 product lines", "Nationwide sales coverage with distribution centers in Minnesota, Nevada, and Texas", "Proprietary Quick Pick inventory management system for repeat orders", "Comprehensive value-added services including striping, twisting, kitting, and custom cable design"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Savage, Minnesota -> /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /about-us", "60 years of experience -> /about-us", "Operating affiliate of LAPP -> /about-us", "Distribution centers in Nevada and Texas -> /about-us", "Value-added services: