UPDATE companies SET description='Lafayette Textiles Corp operates from Vernon, California, where it has been developing knit fabrics for over 35 years. President Sean Zahedi leads the company, which began as an innovator in textile design and now runs a fully integrated domestic production facility.

The company knits, dyes, and finishes its own fabrics on circular knitting machines ranging from 4‑cut to 28‑cut gauge. Its capabilities cover jersey, French terry, fleece, loop terry, interlock, rib, thermal, pique, ponte de roma, and diagonal French terry constructions, with a focus on sustainable fibers such as organic cotton, recycled cotton, and bamboo blends. Production minimums typically run 500–1,000 yards per color and construction.

Lafayette serves the apparel industry, supplying brands and designers who need quick‑turn domestic knits. Its fabrics have been used for merchandise by acts such as Rufus Du Sol, and the company maintains a New York contact for East Coast clients.

Zahedi has emphasized a two‑pronged sustainability approach: producing eco‑friendly fabrics while reducing water use in dyeing and finishing. The firm highlights its made‑in‑USA supply chain, dedicated machines that prevent fiber contamination, and lead times of two to four weeks as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Circular Knitting", "Knitting", "Dyeing", "Finishing", "Jersey", "French Terry", "Sweater Knit", "Recycled Organic Cotton Jersey", "Fleece", "Loop Terry", "Interlock", "Rib", "Thermal", "Pique", "Ponte de Roma", "Diagonal French Terry"], "industries": ["Apparel Industry Regulation"], "materials": ["Cotton", "Polyester", "Rayon", "Bamboo", "Organic Cotton", "Recycled Cotton", "Spandex"], "equipment": ["Circular knitting machines (4\u2011cut to 28\u2011cut gauge)"], "volume": "Minimum order 500\u20131,000 yards", "lead_time": "2\u20134 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["All fabrics knitted, dyed, and finished in the USA", "Lead times of 2\u20134 weeks on stocked yarns", "Owned circular knitting machines (4\u2011cut to 28\u2011cut) for full production control", "Dedicated machines per fiber to eliminate contamination", "Sustainable practices including water\u2011saving dye techniques"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Vernon, California -> db", "35+ years experience -> /", "President: Sean Zahedi -> /", "Processes: knitting, dyeing, finishing -> /", "Equipment: circular knitting machines 4\u2011cut to 28\u2011cut -> /", "Fabric constructions: jersey, French terry, fleece, loop terry, interlock, rib, thermal, pique, ponte de roma, diagonal French terry -> /", "Sustainable fibers: organic cotton, recycled cotton, bamboo blends -> /", "Lead time: 2\u20134 weeks -> /", "Made in USA claim -> /", "Dedicated machines to prevent contamination -> /", "Production minimums: 500\u20131,000 yards -> /", "Industry served: Apparel Industry Regulation -> db", "Merchandise for Rufus Du Sol -> /", "New York contact: Parisa 