UPDATE companies SET description='Lake Shore Electric Corporation was founded in Cleveland, Ohio, in 1922 and today operates from its headquarters in Bedford, Ohio. The company is organized as a limited liability company (Lake Shore Electric, LLC) and has spent more than a century developing power distribution equipment for industrial, utility, and data-center customers.

The firm designs, fabricates, and assembles commercial and industrial electrical equipment entirely in-house, a vertically integrated model that covers sheet metal, copper, and stainless-steel fabrication through final assembly and testing. Its six product lines — Enclosure, Distribute, eHOUSE, Control, Connect, and Transfer — include switchgear, transfer switches, prefabricated electrical buildings (e-houses), and custom enclosures built to project specifications. Design-build capabilities allow the engineering team to work from concept through commissioning, and the component-agnostic approach avoids vendor lock-in.

Lake Shore Electric serves data centers, utilities, industrial manufacturing plants, oil and gas operations, mining sites, wastewater treatment facilities, and commercial buildings. Recent projects include UL 891 switchboards for utility-scale battery energy storage systems, a custom EV charging switchboard for Greenlane Infrastructure in California, and prefabricated electrical equipment houses for customers facing year-long lead times elsewhere.

The company emphasizes its U.S.-based fabrication, fast turnaround times, and compliance with Build America, Buy America (BABA) requirements as key differentiators. A track record of more than 50 years manufacturing UL-listed products, combined with in-house testing before shipment, underpins its focus on reliability and reduced downtime for mission-critical installations.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sheet metal fabrication", "Copper fabrication", "Stainless steel fabrication", "In-house fabrication and assembly", "Design-build engineering", "Custom power distribution equipment manufacturing", "Switchgear manufacturing", "Transfer switch manufacturing", "Prefabricated electrical building (e-house) manufacturing", "Custom enclosure manufacturing", "UL-listed product manufacturing", "BABA compliance certification", "Pre-shipment testing", "Application engineering support", "Technical support", "Component-agnostic system integration"], "industries": ["Data centers", "Utilities", "Industrial manufacturing", "Oil and gas", "Mining", "Wastewater treatment", "Commercial facilities", "Battery energy storage", "EV charging infrastructure"], "materials": ["Sheet metal", "Copper", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated in-house fabrication and assembly", "Design-build capabilities from concept through commissioning", "Component-agnostic designs compatible with a wide range of systems", "U.S.-based fabrication with fast lead times", "Over 50 years of UL-listed product manufacturing"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1922 in Cleveland, Ohio -> /", "Headquartered in Bedford, Ohio -> /", "Specializes in sheet metal, copper, and stainless-steel fabrication -> /", "Vertically integrated in-house fabrication and assembly -> /", "Design-build capabilities from concept through commissioning -> /", "Industries served: data centers, utilities, industrial manufacturin