UPDATE companies SET description='Lenex Steel is headquartered in Indianapolis, Indiana. The company has been delivering complex structural steel projects for over two decades, serving clients across the United States.

The firm provides a full suite of structural steel services, including fabrication, value engineering, connection design, design-assist, design-build, and plan-and-spec execution. Each project is managed by a dedicated team and a single project manager from initial drawings through final delivery, eliminating handoffs and ensuring accountability. The company handles structural, heavy, complex, and miscellaneous steel packages for projects of varying scale.

Lenex Steel works primarily with general contractors, developers, architects, and engineers in the industrial and automotive sectors, among others. Its project portfolio spans operating rooms, manufacturing facilities, arena floors, and other high-profile buildings that define industries and communities nationwide.

The company emphasizes a single-point-of-responsibility model for the entire steel package, combining fabrication with design and project management to reduce risk and streamline schedules. This integrated approach, rooted in decades of Midwest expertise, is designed to overcome obstacles before construction begins and to deliver structures on schedule and to specification.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Steel fabrication", "Value engineering", "Connection design", "Design assist", "Design build", "Plan and spec"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single point of responsibility for the entire steel package", "Dedicated project manager from day one with no handoffs", "Value engineering to optimize structures before design lock", "Design-assist to resolve construction challenges early", "Integrated design-build and plan-and-spec execution"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Indianapolis, Indiana -> db", "Over 20 years of experience -> page \"/\"", "Services: steel fabrication, value engineering, connection design, design assist, design build, plan & spec -> page \"/\"", "Industries served: Industrial & Automotive -> db", "Customer types: general contractors, developers, architects, engineers -> page \"/\"", "Single point of responsibility for entire steel package -> page \"/\"", "Dedicated team and single project manager -> page \"/\"", "No handoffs, tighter accountability -> page \"/\"", "Midwest expertise, nationwide service -> page \"/\""], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We partner with general contractors and developers nationwide \u2014 bringing precision fabrication, project management, and design-build expertise to every project.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags":