UPDATE companies SET description='Live Wire Electric Service operates from Allenstown, New Hampshire. The company was founded by Anthony Minicucci, who serves as president, with the stated goal of delivering honesty, integrity, and excellence in every aspect of operations. Minicucci established the business to embody the qualities he would value as a consumer.

The firm provides licensed and insured electrical contracting for both residential and commercial projects.

The company cites work in communities such as Bedford, Derry, Goffstown, Hooksett, Londonderry, and Merrimack as examples of its geographic reach.

