UPDATE companies SET description='Los Angeles Fashion Consulting & Production operates from a studio in Los Angeles, California. The company was founded to provide integrated design, manufacturing, and sourcing services for fashion brands, though its exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The firm offers a full spectrum of apparel development services under one roof: fashion design consulting, tech pack creation, pattern making, sample development, and end-to-end manufacturing solutions. It also manages sourcing and supply chain logistics, connecting clients with material suppliers and production partners. The team works from a local Los Angeles studio, allowing brands to collaborate in person from initial concept through finished garment.

Clients range from early-stage fashion startups launching their first collection to established labels scaling production. The company has worked with brands such as FEFU (From Earth For Us), which praised the team’s ability to execute patterns to specification. Its guides address topics like cut-and-sew versus private label, finding a clothing manufacturer in Los Angeles, and pricing for wholesale and retail.

The company emphasizes sustainable practices, offering strategies for eco-friendly sourcing and production to minimize environmental impact. Its stated differentiators include housing design, manufacturing, and sourcing disciplines in a single location, providing a local Los Angeles studio for face-to-face collaboration, and delivering end-to-end manufacturing services that take a brand from sketch to finished product.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fashion design consulting", "Tech pack creation", "Pattern making", "Sample development", "Cut and sew manufacturing", "Production management", "Sourcing and supply chain management", "Sustainable sourcing strategies"], "industries": ["Fashion", "Apparel", "Clothing", "Textiles", "Consumer goods"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Design, manufacturing, and sourcing under one roof", "Local Los Angeles studio for in-person collaboration", "Sustainable and eco-friendly sourcing strategies", "End-to-end manufacturing services from concept to finished garment"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Los Angeles Fashion Consulting & Production -> db", "Headquarters: Los Angeles, California -> db", "Services: fashion design consulting, tech pack creation, pattern making, sample development, manufacturing solutions, sourcing & supply chain -> /", "Three disciplines under one roof: design, manufacturing, sourcing -> /", "Local Los Angeles studio for in-person collaboration -> /", "Client example: FEFU (From Earth For Us) -> /", "Sustainable practices and eco-friendly sourcing strategies -> /", "Guides on cut-and-sew vs private label, finding a clothing manufacturer in LA, pricing -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "End-to-end manufacturing services, ensuring your products are produced with the highest standards of quality and efficiency.", "founded_year": "", "employee_coun