UPDATE companies SET description='Louisiana Fish Fry Products traces its roots to 1959, when Tony Pizzolato opened a small produce stand in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. By 1972 the stand had grown into a thriving seafood business, and in 1982 the company was formally established as Louisiana Fish Fry Products to bring authentic Cajun flavors to a wider audience. The business remains US-owned and US-made, with its plant and headquarters still in Baton Rouge.

The company manufactures a range of dry mixes and seasonings, including batters and coatings for frying, seafood boil blends, baking mixes, sauces and marinades, entrée and rice mixes, spices and seasonings, and gift boxes. Production takes place at its Baton Rouge facility, where recipes developed over more than six decades are blended and packaged for both retail shelves and foodservice distributors.

Louisiana Fish Fry Products serves two primary channels: retail consumers through grocery stores and foodservice operators such as restaurants, institutions, and caterers. The foodservice line offers larger package sizes for high-volume cooking, while the retail line provides consumer-friendly portions for home cooks preparing dishes like crawfish boils, fried chicken, and gumbo.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Batters & Coatings", "Seafood Boils", "Baking Mixes", "Sauces & Marinades", "Entrees & Rice Mixes", "Spices & Seasonings", "Gift Boxes"], "industries": ["Retail", "Foodservice"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["US-owned and US-made with plant and headquarters in Baton Rouge", "Over 60 years of recipe development dating to 1959", "Authentic Cajun-inspired product formulations", "Foodservice and retail packaging options", "Domestic manufacturing of all products"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1959 as produce stand by Tony Pizzolato -> /about", "Formally established as Louisiana Fish Fry Products in 1982 -> /about", "Headquarters and plant in Baton Rouge, Louisiana -> /about, db", "US-owned and US-made -> /about", "Product categories: batters & coatings, seafood boils, baking mixes, sauces & marinades, entrees & rice mixes, spices & seasonings, gift boxes -> /, /about", "Serves retail and foodservice channels -> /about", "Foodservice offers larger package sizes -> /about", "Commitment to authentic Louisiana-style dishes from finest ingredients -> /about", "Over 60 years perfecting recipes -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Louisiana Fish Fry Products was established to bring the true taste of Louisiana to a wider audience, with Cajun-inspired products that are authentic and easy to prepare.", "founded_year": "1982", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_l