UPDATE companies SET description='The studio positions itself as a boutique operation offering personalized attention from concept through finished goods.

The company delivers end-to-end cut-and-sew production entirely in-house. Product categories include t-shirts, leggings, jeans, hoodies, jackets, underwear, and sweatshirts, all customizable with custom labels, tags, and packaging.

