UPDATE companies SET description='MK Fluidic Systems was established in 2012 in Las Vegas, Nevada, as a privately owned, family‑operated business. The company traces its roots to founder Mike Kloehn, who spent over 30 years in medical manufacturing helping build the firm his father started in 1970. After that business was sold in 2007, Kloehn saw an opportunity to create a U.S.-based facility focused on premium‑quality, cost‑effective fluidic components for OEMs.

