UPDATE companies SET description='Maine Solar was founded in 1975 by Floyd Severn in Farmington, Maine. For nearly five decades, the company served as a cornerstone of Central Maine''s solar community, helping homeowners and businesses pursue energy independence long before solar power entered mainstream conversation. Severn built the business on a foundation of honesty and expert knowledge, driven by a belief that Maine residents deserve clean, affordable power on their own terms.

